sale was eight oscillators to Disney Studios in 1939 [Packard, 1995]. In 1947,
Hewlett-Packard was incorporated to provide for continuity of life for the firm
as well as limited liability for the owners.
     In general, many businesses start out as sole proprietorships or partnerships
but soon migrate to LLCs or a corporate form. With unlimited liability as a risk
