beyond the initial period necessary for completing a business plan. Most inves-
tors will only be willing to invest in a corporation or LLC since they wish to
avoid any liability beyond the amount of their investment. The personal liability
of a regular corporation or an LLC is limited to the amount of capital contributed
to the entity by that person.


